#: reask of a turn whose OWN answer was generated and sent but whose playback
#: the phone never confirmed — no receipt at all (a text-only reply, audio
#: queued that never played back, the relay's own gap timer, the socket gone).
#: That is UNKNOWN, not heard and not unheard, so the wording claims NEITHER:
#: not that the caller heard it (the old "answered"), not that it "did not
#: reach them" (the unheard line).
